  "consensus-algorithms-raft-amp-paxos.md": "# Consensus Algorithms: Raft &amp; Paxos\n\n## Overview\nWelcome to the module on **Consensus Algorithms: Raft &amp; Paxos**. This page covers the following related subtopics:\n\n- Raft \u2014 leader election, log replication, safety guarantees (easier than Paxos)\n- Raft leader election \u2014 candidate, follower, leader roles; randomized timeouts\n- Log replication \u2014 leader appends, replicates to quorum, commits\n- Paxos \u2014 original consensus algorithm, harder to understand and implement\n- Used in: etcd (Kubernetes), ZooKeeper, CockroachDB, MongoDB (replica sets)\n\n---\n\n## Raft \u2014 leader election, log replication, safety guarantees (easier than Paxos)\n\nDetailed content for **Raft \u2014 leader election, log replication, safety guarantees (easier than Paxos)** is currently being formulated. Check back soon!\n\n## Raft leader election \u2014 candidate, follower, leader roles; randomized timeouts\n\nDetailed content for **Raft leader election \u2014 candidate, follower, leader roles; randomized timeouts** is currently being formulated. Check back soon!\n\n## Log replication \u2014 leader appends, replicates to quorum, commits\n\nDetailed content for **Log replication \u2014 leader appends, replicates to quorum, commits** is currently being formulated. Check back soon!\n\n## Paxos \u2014 original consensus algorithm, harder to understand and implement\n\nDetailed content for **Paxos \u2014 original consensus algorithm, harder to understand and implement** is currently being formulated. Check back soon!\n\n## Used in: etcd (Kubernetes), ZooKeeper, CockroachDB, MongoDB (replica sets)\n\nDetailed content for **Used in: etcd (Kubernetes), ZooKeeper, CockroachDB, MongoDB (replica sets)** is currently being formulated. Check back soon!\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Teacher's Note:** This is the *Light-Depth Baseline Version* of this tutorial. We will upgrade this page with deep-dives shortly!\n",
