  "distributed-transactions-amp-sagas.md": "# Distributed Transactions &amp; Sagas\n\n## Overview\nWelcome to the module on **Distributed Transactions &amp; Sagas**. This page covers the following related subtopics:\n\n- Two-Phase Commit (2PC) \u2014 prepare + commit phases, blocks on coordinator failure\n- SAGA \u2014 chain of local txns + compensating actions, no distributed lock\n- Transactional Outbox \u2014 write DB + outbox atomically, publish from outbox\n- Vector clocks \u2014 track causality, detect concurrent writes\n\n---\n\n## Two-Phase Commit (2PC) \u2014 prepare + commit phases, blocks on coordinator failure\n\nDetailed content for **Two-Phase Commit (2PC) \u2014 prepare + commit phases, blocks on coordinator failure** is currently being formulated. Check back soon!\n\n## SAGA \u2014 chain of local txns + compensating actions, no distributed lock\n\nDetailed content for **SAGA \u2014 chain of local txns + compensating actions, no distributed lock** is currently being formulated. Check back soon!\n\n## Transactional Outbox \u2014 write DB + outbox atomically, publish from outbox\n\nDetailed content for **Transactional Outbox \u2014 write DB + outbox atomically, publish from outbox** is currently being formulated. Check back soon!\n\n## Vector clocks \u2014 track causality, detect concurrent writes\n\nDetailed content for **Vector clocks \u2014 track causality, detect concurrent writes** is currently being formulated. Check back soon!\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Teacher's Note:** This is the *Light-Depth Baseline Version* of this tutorial. We will upgrade this page with deep-dives shortly!\n",
