  "message-queues-vs-event-streams.md": "# Message Queues vs Event Streams\n\n## Overview\nWelcome to the module on **Message Queues vs Event Streams**. This page covers the following related subtopics:\n\n- Message queue (SQS, RabbitMQ) \u2014 message consumed \u2192 gone, work distribution\n- Event stream (Kafka, Kinesis) \u2014 durable append-only log, replay, multiple consumer groups\n- Pub/Sub (SNS, Google Pub/Sub) \u2014 topic fan-out to many subscribers\n- DB-as-queue antipattern \u2014 polling creates lock contention, never do this\n\n---\n\n## Message queue (SQS, RabbitMQ) \u2014 message consumed \u2192 gone, work distribution\n\nDetailed content for **Message queue (SQS, RabbitMQ) \u2014 message consumed \u2192 gone, work distribution** is currently being formulated. Check back soon!\n\n## Event stream (Kafka, Kinesis) \u2014 durable append-only log, replay, multiple consumer groups\n\nDetailed content for **Event stream (Kafka, Kinesis) \u2014 durable append-only log, replay, multiple consumer groups** is currently being formulated. Check back soon!\n\n## Pub/Sub (SNS, Google Pub/Sub) \u2014 topic fan-out to many subscribers\n\nDetailed content for **Pub/Sub (SNS, Google Pub/Sub) \u2014 topic fan-out to many subscribers** is currently being formulated. Check back soon!\n\n## DB-as-queue antipattern \u2014 polling creates lock contention, never do this\n\nDetailed content for **DB-as-queue antipattern \u2014 polling creates lock contention, never do this** is currently being formulated. Check back soon!\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Teacher's Note:** This is the *Light-Depth Baseline Version* of this tutorial. We will upgrade this page with deep-dives shortly!\n",
  "metrics-dashboards-alerting.md": "# Metrics, Dashboards & Alerting\n\n## Overview\nWelcome to the module on **Metrics, Dashboards & Alerting**.\n\n## 4 Golden Signals: latency, traffic, errors, saturation (Google SRE)\n\nDetailed content for **4 Golden Signals: latency, traffic, errors, saturation (Google SRE)** is currently being formulated.\n\n## RED method (Rate, Errors, Duration) \u2014 per-service health\n\nDetailed content for **RED method (Rate, Errors, Duration) \u2014 per-service health** is currently being formulated.\n\n## USE method (Utilization, Saturation, Errors) \u2014 for infrastructure resources\n\nDetailed content for **USE method (Utilization, Saturation, Errors) \u2014 for infrastructure resources** is currently being formulated.\n\n## Prometheus scrape model \u2014 pull metrics from /metrics endpoints\n\nDetailed content for **Prometheus scrape model \u2014 pull metrics from /metrics endpoints** is currently being formulated.\n\n## Alertmanager \u2014 route alerts to PagerDuty, Slack, email\n\nDetailed content for **Alertmanager \u2014 route alerts to PagerDuty, Slack, email** is currently being formulated.\n\n",
